### Background
The Account model currently has no timestamp fields. We need to track when accounts are created and when they're last modified (e.g., when balance changes).

### Objective
Add `created_at` and `updated_at` fields to the Account interface and factory function.

### Files to Modify
- `src/models/account.ts`

### Implementation Details
