### Background
The Transaction model needs both a system timestamp (when recorded) and an effective_date (when it actually occurred). This allows backdating transactions, e.g., recording a Jan 10 payment on Jan 13.

### Objective
Add `created_at` and `effective_date` fields to the Transaction interface and factory function.

### Files to Modify
