### Background
Optimistic locking requires a version number that increments on each update. This task adds the version field to the Account model.

### Objective
Add `version` field to Account interface and factory function, starting at 1 for new accounts.

### Files to Modify
- `src/models/account.ts`

### Implementation Details
```typescript
export interface Account {
  id: string;
  name: string | null;
  direction: Direction;
  balance: number;
  version: number;      // NEW
  created_at: Date;
  updated_at: Date;
}

export const createAccount = (params: CreateAccountParams): Account => ({
  id: params.id ?? uuidv4(),
  name: params.name ?? null,
